    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a zany, fast-paced arcade puzzle adventure where you must strategically box in mischievous frooblies to purify your carbonated concoction before time runs out. With each second ticking closer to failure and the variety of special frooblies, your reflexes and wits will be put to the test. Climb the online leaderboards and prove you're the ultimate soda savant!  <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752580/extras/0a5b9491152e9dff3105fdc7fe03ee5e.poster.avif?t=1750423643\" width=250 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752580/extras/0a5b9491152e9dff3105fdc7fe03ee5e.webm?t=1750423643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>Strategic Boxing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enclose the exact number of specified frooblies  within a single box\u2014no more, no less. Precision and speed are key!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time Trials\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is a race against the clock. Complete objectives swiftly to avoid losing hearts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Online Leaderboards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Compete globally to achieve the highest scores and showcase your soda-cleansing prowess.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vibrant Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy colorful and quirky graphics that bring the world of <i>Sinister Sodies</i> to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An energetic soundtrack that keeps you immersed and on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With varying objectives and frooblies  combinations, each playthrough offers a fresh experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752580/extras/5bfe99d2b798ef6a36dab032c893b65c.poster.avif?t=1750423643\" width=250 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752580/extras/5bfe99d2b798ef6a36dab032c893b65c.webm?t=1750423643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on this effervescent journey and master the art of frooblies  boxing. Whether you're aiming for the top of the leaderboards or just looking for a fun challenge, <i>Sinister Sodies</i> offers a refreshing twist on classic puzzle gameplay.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a zany, fast-paced arcade puzzle adventure where you must strategically box in mischievous frooblies to purify your carbonated concoction before time runs out. With each second ticking closer to failure and the variety of special frooblies, your reflexes and wits will be put to the test. Climb the online leaderboards and prove you're the ultimate soda savant!  <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752580/extras/0a5b9491152e9dff3105fdc7fe03ee5e.poster.avif?t=1750423643\" width=250 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752580/extras/0a5b9491152e9dff3105fdc7fe03ee5e.webm?t=1750423643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>Strategic Boxing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enclose the exact number of specified frooblies  within a single box\u2014no more, no less. Precision and speed are key!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time Trials\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is a race against the clock. Complete objectives swiftly to avoid losing hearts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Online Leaderboards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Compete globally to achieve the highest scores and showcase your soda-cleansing prowess.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vibrant Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy colorful and quirky graphics that bring the world of <i>Sinister Sodies</i> to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An energetic